Place the background music here as: wedding-music.mp3

Pick something romantic, cinematic and soft — solo piano or piano with light
strings suits the invitation best, at a level that sits under the page rather
than performing over it.

Two sources with licences that allow this use:

  · Pixabay Music  — https://pixabay.com/music/search/wedding%20piano/
    The Pixabay Content Licence permits commercial and non-commercial use with
    no attribution required. Simplest option.

  · Free Stock Music — https://www.free-stock-music.com/piano.html
    Largely CC BY 4.0, which is free to use but *does* require crediting the
    composer somewhere on the page.

Do not rip the track from a streaming site or lift the audio from another
wedding website — neither is licensed for this.

While this file is absent the floating music control does not render at all,
and the envelope opens silently. Nothing else changes.
